public class WeeklyCheckinSettlement { static class GymMember{static int n=2000;final String membershipNumber="GYM-"+(++n);int fees;GymMember(int f){}void payFee(int a){fees+=a;}void payFee(int a,String mode){System.out.println(mode);payFee(a);}static boolean isValidReferralCode(String c){return c!=null&&c.length()==4&&c.charAt(0)=='G'&&Character.isDigit(c.charAt(1))&&Character.isDigit(c.charAt(2))&&Character.isUpperCase(c.charAt(3));}}static class GroupClassMember extends GymMember{GroupClassMember(int f,String c){super(f);}}static String processWeeklyCheckIn(GymMember[] x){int ok=0,nil=0,g=0;for(GymMember m:x){if(m==null){nil++;continue;}ok++;if(m instanceof GroupClassMember)g++;}return ok+" processed | "+nil+" null skipped | "+g+" group | "+(ok-g)+" individual";}public static void main(String[]a){System.out.println(processWeeklyCheckIn(new GymMember[]{new GroupClassMember(1500,"Zumba"),null,new GymMember(1000)}));} }
